<title>USA: Endesa sets 4-to-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Endesa sets 4-to-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Endesa, a large electric utility company in Spain, said Thursday that it has set a four-to-one stock split.</p>
<p>The company said the split was set at its annual general shareholders meeting on June 25.</p>
<p>Endesa said the split would reduce the nominal value of its shares to Pta 200 from Pta 800, while simultaneously increasing by four the number of representative shares of its capital.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
